{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的部分感受句比较长，瞬间扫读不如 Y 的短词直接，尤其在 S13 收束段，信息稍显密集。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 的加亮关键词让普通观众不用读完每句话，也能抓住人物每一段的心理转折和关键矛盾；感受又以小字和分时出现，能跟着音乐逐步接收，不至于一开始就被大量信息淹没。更重要的是，X 的感受往往能把人物为什么难受、为什么短暂高兴、为什么又陷入矛盾具体表现出来，前后情绪变化有承接。Y 的左右分栏虽然有利于快速分区，但右侧短词经常堆积过多，部分只是情绪标签或意象罗列，需要观众自行拼接，细腻程度和叙事连贯性不如 X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "4fd2bb7a-95fb-4056-83b7-885c10a113af", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T031950699405Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.171, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T03:20:33.886136+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5fb545e4ff244777c37c9c239114e4c618f84a78a88e547bff8ed65c8e3c5a57", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tool